{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=1272080&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-11-07T19:37:17Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"1272080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PAYDAY 3", "steam_appid": 1272080, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "dlc": [5367280, 5101770, 4640190, 4533420, 3450550, 3214920, 3171990, 3172010, 2450697, 3111880, 2450694, 2450695, 2450691, 2450692, 2438800], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New York doesn't give. You take it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAYDAY 3 is a 1-to-4 player co-op FPS and the ultimate heist fantasy, set in the most iconic city in the world. Gone without a trace or through a hail of bullets. Either way, you're getting out with the prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/c7d64e1910a55442945af1553921bac8.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"The City is the Target\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/c7d64e1910a55442945af1553921bac8.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just any city, it's <i>the</i> city. From the financial fortresses of Wall Street to Manhattan penthouses and the streets in between. The city that never sleeps, a playground for the perfect crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/77299bd55cec18513fe19f1624f52e55.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"The Mask Changes Everything\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/77299bd55cec18513fe19f1624f52e55.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment, a part of the crowd; the next, you are infamous. Build your own heister with custom looks, loadout, and skills, and step into the world's most recognizable crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/e2224c54bf9f197ae5d79dddeed3e05d.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"Plan it Quiet, Finish it Loud\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/e2224c54bf9f197ae5d79dddeed3e05d.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plan is only perfect until it isn't. The job doesn't end when the alarm sounds; it just gets louder. Cops, SWAT, and Special Units converge to shut you down, and your crew has to fight its way out with the loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/383a8f23d1555ee3bbfb901aae29b5ec.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"Your Crew, Your Greatest Weapon\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/383a8f23d1555ee3bbfb901aae29b5ec.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate everything with a tight crew, find one along the way. Every role matters when the law pushes back, and a crew that holds its nerve under pressure is the difference between a clean getaway and a very bad day.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New York doesn't give. You take it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAYDAY 3 is a 1-to-4 player co-op FPS and the ultimate heist fantasy, set in the most iconic city in the world. Gone without a trace or through a hail of bullets. Either way, you're getting out with the prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/c7d64e1910a55442945af1553921bac8.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"The City is the Target\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/c7d64e1910a55442945af1553921bac8.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just any city, it's <i>the</i> city. From the financial fortresses of Wall Street to Manhattan penthouses and the streets in between. The city that never sleeps, a playground for the perfect crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/77299bd55cec18513fe19f1624f52e55.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"The Mask Changes Everything\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/77299bd55cec18513fe19f1624f52e55.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One moment, a part of the crowd; the next, you are infamous. Build your own heister with custom looks, loadout, and skills, and step into the world's most recognizable crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/e2224c54bf9f197ae5d79dddeed3e05d.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"Plan it Quiet, Finish it Loud\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/e2224c54bf9f197ae5d79dddeed3e05d.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The plan is only perfect until it isn't. The job doesn't end when the alarm sounds; it just gets louder. Cops, SWAT, and Special Units converge to shut you down, and your crew has to fight its way out with the loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/383a8f23d1555ee3bbfb901aae29b5ec.avif?t=1793958317\" alt=\"Your Crew, Your Greatest Weapon\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/383a8f23d1555ee3bbfb901aae29b5ec.avif?t=1793958317 width=1560 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate everything with a tight crew, find one along the way. Every role matters when the law pushes back, and a crew that holds its nerve under pressure is the difference between a clean getaway and a very bad day.</p>", "short_description": "PAYDAY 3 is a 1-to-4 player co-op FPS and the ultimate heist fantasy, set in the most iconic city in the world. Gone without a trace or through a hail of bullets. Either way, you're getting out with the prize.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/3d85d86a3d2c792046792b19df83ceca0e6c58d3/header_alt_assets_12.jpg?t=1793958317", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/424cbd91327051429deb7c21b95f269113734fa6/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_12.jpg?t=1793958317", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/424cbd91327051429